					<p class="mt-3">
						Any operational consulting, implementation, or ongoing support services referenced on this
						site are subject to a separate scope of work or agreement entered into directly with Method
						&amp; Measure. Nothing on this website constitutes an offer to provide services on specific
						terms until such an agreement is signed by both parties.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Digital Products</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						Templates, workbooks, checklists, and other digital products sold through this site
						("Digital Products") are licensed, not sold, subject to the following terms:
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2 list-disc pl-5">
						<li>Digital Products are for your own internal business use only.</li>
						<li>You may not resell, redistribute, share, or republish Digital Products, in whole or in part, in any format, including as part of another product or course.</li>
						<li>You may customize Digital Products for your own business but may not claim authorship of the underlying template or system itself.</li>
						<li>Digital Products are delivered electronically. Access details and delivery are provided through our checkout provider at the time of purchase.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Payment &amp; Refunds</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						Digital Product purchases are processed by a third-party payment provider. Because Digital
						Products are delivered instantly and electronically, all sales are final and non-refundable
						except where required by law. If you experience a technical issue with a purchase, contact
						us and we will make it right.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Intellectual Property</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						All content on this site and within our Digital Products — including text, systems,
						templates, graphics, and branding — is the property of Method &amp; Measure and is
						protected by applicable intellectual property laws. No license is granted to use our
						intellectual property except as expressly stated in these Terms.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">No Guarantee of Results</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						Digital Products and general content on this site are educational and operational tools.
						They are not a substitute for legal, financial, tax, or professional advice specific to
						your business, and we make no guarantee of specific business results from their use.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Limitation of Liability</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						To the fullest extent permitted by law, Method &amp; Measure is not liable for any indirect,
						incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this site or our Digital
						Products.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Changes to These Terms</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by an
						updated "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the site after
						changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-brand-black">Contact Us</h2>
					<p class="mt-3">
						Questions about these Terms can be directed to us through the contact form on our homepage.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
